<title>SOUTH AFRICA: AROMA LIQUOR IN TALKS TO SELL AT DISCOUNT.</title>
<headline>AROMA LIQUOR IN TALKS TO SELL AT DISCOUNT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aroma Liquor Holdings Ltd said on Monday it was in talks which could involve the sale of a controlling interest in the company at a substantial discount to Friday's closing share price of 224 rand.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
